 assert old in t;t=t.replace(old,'The historical64-row snapshot and mechanism readout remain under `runs/v2111_paper_parallel_readout/`. Current72-row classifications and input hashes are under `runs/v2130_common_results_readout/`. Canonical development results are separately under V2137(PSF), V2135/V2141(PCBF), and V2144(SCCR depth acquisition). This reporting update adds no model, optimizer, physics, replay or new independent physical audit. Its provenance records exact input SHA256 values; late edits are not claimed to be included in earlier sealed Releases.')
